# The pause menu over a running game: a CAMBER race.
# Run: --boot off --fps 30 --frames 390
#
# Home screen: one step right to the CAMBER tile, start it.
10 press right
11 release right
20 press south
21 release south
# 21-59: CAMBER's title menu over its live backdrop; PLAY is chosen
60 press south
61 release south
# 61-100: the start count 3, 2, 1, GO
# 80: hold the thrust (ZR) from the count on and race the first lap
80 press zr
# 240: on the green strip, the home button pauses the game; the console's
#      pause menu (RESUME, brightness, BACK TO HOME) stands over the still
#      race
240 press home
241 release home
# 262: down to the brightness bars; 276 one step dimmer, 290 one step
#      brighter again; 306 up to RESUME
262 press down
263 release down
276 press left
277 release left
290 press right
291 release right
306 press up
307 release up
# 322: OK on RESUME: the menu goes, the race goes on (ZR still held)
322 press south
323 release south
# 323-389: the race again, along the green strip to the orange arrows
